    ["· The maximum level for Secret Bonds is 7. Upon reaching the maximum level, excess favorability will be automatically converted into [Memory Caskets] at a 10:1 ratio, which can be exchanged for various appearances at the [Past Exhibition Hall] shop. \n · When Beyonders participate in interactions such as strolling, inviting, or dancing with contacts, they can consume [Memory Invitations] and gain favorability. The first interaction with a contact each day does not consume an invitation ticket; this free attempt is shared among all contacts. \n · After interacting with the same contact in the same way and using an invitation ticket, subsequent interactions of the same type on the same day will not consume invitation tickets, nor will they grant favorability. \n · Strolling: Only available in the open world; it will be automatically canceled upon entering dungeons or other non-open-world scenes. \n · Once the favorability level between a Beyonder and a corresponding contact reaches level 2, you can obtain 2 invitation collection attempts for that contact daily (the number of attempts increases with the favorability level). Consuming these attempts and the corresponding number of [Memory Invitations] allows the Beyonder to directly complete the corresponding quick interaction and obtain the contact's favorability and rewards. \n · Beyonders can also obtain 5 invitation collection attempts shared across all contacts daily, up to a maximum of 15 (shared across all contacts), but this requires the Beyonder to unlock [Fool's Gospel] to use these attempts. \n · When a Beyonder performs quick interactions with a contact, the contact's own invitation collection attempts are consumed first, followed by the attempts shared across all contacts."] = "· The maximum level for Secret Bonds is 7. Upon reaching the maximum level, excess favorability will be automatically converted into [Memory Caskets] at a 10:1 ratio, which can be exchanged for various appearances at the [Past Exhibition Hall] shop. \n · When Потустороннийs participate in interactions such as strolling, inviting, or dancing with contacts, they can consume [Memory Invitations] and gain favorability. The first interaction with a contact each day does not consume an invitation ticket; this free attempt is shared among all contacts. \n · After interacting with the same contact in the same way and using an invitation ticket, subsequent interactions of the same type on the same day will not consume invitation tickets, nor will they grant favorability. \n · Strolling: Only available in the open world; it will be automatically canceled upon entering dungeons or other non-open-world scenes. \n · Once the favorability level between a Потусторонний and a corresponding contact reaches level 2, you can obtain 2 invitation collection attempts for that contact daily (the number of attempts increases with the favorability level). Consuming these attempts and the corresponding number of [Memory Invitations] allows the Потусторонний to directly complete the corresponding quick interaction and obtain the contact's favorability and rewards. \n · Потустороннийs can also obtain 5 invitation collection attempts shared across all contacts daily, up to a maximum of 15 (shared across all contacts), but this requires the Потусторонний to unlock [Fool's Gospel] to use these attempts. \n · When a Потусторонний performs quick interactions with a contact, the contact's own invitation collection attempts are consumed first, followed by the attempts shared across all contacts.",
